335437", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_1029547729668770_8032021325752252129_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j50-WWm0Kw4Q7kNvwHSAi1Z&_nc_oc=Ado-vw6Rho2Doq-EPqxqP9mjTq1367qNeNRRCQL0RS78fhrrN-fhwdYaVYaSJMTjgZk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ0RJ3ZOaL4wXE700_m6Lw7saGGBPmYh_SqlToy6O3egQ&oe=6A9866C7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "02_cover_landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "1814004859764114", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595112037_1814004863097447_5756992983049806520_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gIOP3yOMn-MQ7kNvwFuYqwM&_nc_oc=AdrcKD4V6C5pQ8MbK432w1KPkRahnPkvLfWW-DuZvNaRXRqFtlJ9DYPP6fBwfPLGub8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKgbJ89exHOYRwXozGQPLogoaRSwPQ1btoUhyMgwy-MjQ&oe=6A9853FF"}, "display_name": "Liminal Pool shooter", "keywords": ["vaporwave", "rhythm", "shooter", "liminal", "poolrooms"], "long_description": "Liminal Pool shooter\n\nThe resort never closed. It just kept growing.\n\nIn a parallel night where the bubble era never ended, an endless hotel pool multiplies in the dark \u2014 white tile, black water, fluorescent lights running to a vanishing point. Glowing cocktails drift on the surface: the spirits of a party nobody remembers ending. Lay them to rest.\n\nYou glide forward with a wand in each hand. Shoot the floating drinks IN TIME WITH THE MUSIC \u2014 every hit shatters like glass and rings out a note. Each color you clear stays behind as a small pool of light, drifting away into the dark.\n\nHOW IT PLAYS\n- Shoot the glowing cocktails floating on the water.\n- Shoot ON THE BEAT for critical hits and big combos.\n- Shoot one color and every cocktail of that color on screen chains and pops \u2014 pick the color that pays.\n- Every color scores differently. Watch for a dark one that barely glows \u2014 it is worth a fortune.\n- Shoot the red radio when it appears: it sings a phantom city pop song.\n- Three chapters, three songs, a boss spirit at the end of each. Built to be replayed for score.\n\nMADE FOR VR\nYour two Meta Quest controllers become the twin wands. You move forward automatically at a smooth, constant speed with no artificial camera turns \u2014 play seated or standing. No jump scares, ever.\n\nLiminal Pool shooter \u2014 Shoot the party. Let the colors drift away.", "short_description": "A night pool that never closed. Cocktails glow on black water \u2014 shoot them on the beat, and shooting one color chains every cocktail of that color. Their colors stay behind as drifting lights. One short, strange, beautiful night in VR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://chihuahua-games.chihuahuagames.workers.dev/apps/liminalpool/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ChihuahuaGames", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://chihuahua-games.chihuahuagames.workers.dev/apps/liminalpool/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1176414848891753"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1355358129337713"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1355358129337713"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_